  513                   ;JUMP TABLE TO ROUTINES WITHIN THE MONITOR1.Z80 :-
  514                   
  515                   ;PROGRAM CODE BEGINS HERE
  516                   ;FIRST A JUMP TABLE FOR KEY JUMPS INTO THE MONITOR. NOTE THESE SHOULD NOT BE CHANGED BECAUSE
