  583 F05B              HIGH_CO:
  584         FFFF      IF   V3_Z80CPU_BOARD			; Is this an S100Computers V3 Z80 CPU Board
Z80ASM SuperFast Relocating Macro Assembler     	    Z80ASM 1.30 Page  11
